9","docTitle":"2404.16130_From_Local_to_Global_A_Graph_RAG_Approach_to_Query_Focused_Summarizati","page":3,"quote":"Some prior work proposes criteria for having LLMs quantify the quality of 3 Source Documents Text Chunks text extraction and chunking Entities & Relationships domain-tailored summarization Knowledge Graph domain-tailored summarization"},{"id":"c3","chunkId":"730f1a9f38d16689_c_02012b4621581282","docId":"730f1a9f38d16689","docTitle":"2404.16130_From_Local_to_Global_A_Graph_RAG_Approach_to_Query_Focused_Summarizati","page":4,"quote":"3.1.2 Text Chunks →Entities & Relationships In this step, the LLM is prompted to extract instances of important entities and the relationships between the entities from a given chunk."},{"id":"c4","chunkId":"730f1a9f38d16689_c_4e7880c9886117d5","docId":"730f1a9f38d16689","docTitle":"2404.16130_From_Local_to_Global_A_Graph_RAG_Approach_to_Query_Focused_Summarizati","page":2,"quote":"GraphRAG first uses an LLM to construct a knowledge graph, where nodes correspond to key entities in the corpus and edges represent relationships between those entities."},{"id":"c5","chunkId":"730f1a9f38d16689_c_1b6aedb943798f67","docId":"730f1a9f38d16689","docTitle":"2404.16130_From_Local_to_Global_A_Graph_RAG_Approach_to_Query_Focused_Summarizati","page":22,"quote":"For example: \"Person X is the owner of Company Y and subject to many allegations of wrongdoing [Data: Reports (1), Entities (5, 7); Relationships (23); Claims (7, 2, 34, 64, 46, +more)].\" where 1, 5, 7, 23, 2, 34, 46, and 64 represent the"},{"id":"c6","chunkId":"730f1a9f38d16689_c_02012b4621581282","docId":"730f1a9f38d16689","docTitle":"2404.16130_From_Local_to_Global_A_Graph_RAG_Approach_to_Query_Focused_Summarizati","page":4,"quote":"Additionally, the LLM generates short descriptions for the entities and relationships."},{"id":"c7","chunkId":"396a0fadeb4cd40f_c_d42ce544ea03f0a9","docId":"396a0fadeb4cd40f","docTitle":"2312.10997_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation_for_Large_Language_Models_A_Survey","page":8,"quote":"This KG consists of nodes (representing paragraphs or structures in the documents, such as pages and tables) and edges (indicating semantic/lexical similarity between paragraphs or relationships within the document str"},{"id":"c8","chunkId":"396a0fadeb4cd40f_c_d13a7a33d897ce11","docId":"396a0fadeb4cd40f","docTitle":"2312.10997_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation_for_Large_Language_Models_A_Survey","page":8,"quote":"File are arranged in parent- child relationships, with chunks linked to them."},{"id":"c9","chunkId":"396a0fadeb4cd40f_c_eaeadf987e64c603","docId":"396a0fadeb4cd40f","docTitle":"2312.10997_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation_for_Large_Language_Models_A_Survey","page":8,"quote":"f nodes (representing paragraphs or structures in the documents, such as pages and tables) and edges (indicating semantic/lexical similarity between paragraphs or relationships within the document structure), effectively addressing knowl-"},{"id":"c10","chunkId":"737b0b8fe0aa8459_c_1ba1c10f72bfe2f9","docId":"737b0b8fe0aa8459","docTitle":"2501.00309_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation_with_Graphs_GraphRAG","page":9,"quote":"This method is crucial for tasks that focus on identifying relationships among entities in a graph."},{"id":"c11","chunkId":"737b0b8fe0aa8459_c_3515c21558b999a8","docId":"737b0b8fe0aa8459","docTitle":"2501.00309_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation_with_Graphs_GraphRAG","page":37,"quote":"Starting with 100 randomly selected seed users, the dataset scales to encompass 1.7 million users and around 0.4 billion following relationships, averaging 200 followers per user."},{"id":"c12","chunkId":"737b0b8fe0aa8459_c_532122fabeccc90e","docId":"737b0b8fe0aa8459","docTitle":"2501.00309_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation_with_Graphs_GraphRAG","page":31,"quote":"[449] prompt the LLM to answer the question by providing the retrieved entity names and their relationships in a concatenated form."},{"id":"c13","chunkId":"730f1a9f38d16689_c_f314cc65287ae22f","docId":"730f