hunkId":"737b0b8fe0aa8459_c_62bd9e301b91a980","docId":"737b0b8fe0aa8459","docTitle":"2501.00309_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation_with_Graphs_GraphRAG","page":26,"quote":"• Topology-based Retriever: Various topological relationships in a graph can be used to measure different types of similarity."},{"id":"c19","chunkId":"737b0b8fe0aa8459_c_d4df40b3d6fbfd86","docId":"737b0b8fe0aa8459","docTitle":"2501.00309_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation_with_Graphs_GraphRAG","page":40,"quote":"• Analogy Dependency [499, 503]: This dependency underscores analogical reasoning, where relationships take the form \"A is to B as C is to D.\" By recognizing and leveraging such dependency, humans b"},{"id":"c20","chunkId":"737b0b8fe0aa8459_c_562ae4acee6c4a76","docId":"737b0b8fe0aa8459","docTitle":"2501.00309_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation_with_Graphs_GraphRAG","page":41,"quote":"To adapt RestBench into a graph-structured dataset, [454] treats each API as a unique task node, modeling their relationships through two key dimensions: (1) categorical association and (2) resource dependencies."},{"id":"c21","chunkId":"8bbe93a93b05967d_c_24729fe8ea665697","docId":"8bbe93a93b05967d","docTitle":"2410.13070_Is_Semantic_Chunking_Worth_the_Computational_Cost","page":2,"quote":"Clustering-based Semantic Chunker This type of chunkers leverage clustering algorithms to group sentences together semantically, capturing global relationships and allowing for non-sequential sen- tence groupings."},{"id":"c22","chunkId":"737b0b8fe0aa8459_c_57e0ba6b88f8a81e","docId":"737b0b8fe0aa8459","docTitle":"2501.00309_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation_with_Graphs_GraphRAG","page":24,"quote":"Thus, it becomes essential to consider document-level relationships in the retrieval process."},{"id":"c23","chunkId":"737b0b8fe0aa8459_c_8bf24531e63f4ab4","docId":"737b0b8fe0aa8459","docTitle":"2501.00309_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation_with_Graphs_GraphRAG","page":17,"quote":"• Explicit Construction: Explicit construction refers to building 